WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:07.686
Pear's new home screen, HomeView, is sold
on privacy. But whose privacy?

00:00:08.636 --> 00:00:14.650
In Pear's own ad, the brother tries to read his
sister's messages. Only her face unlocks them.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:22.150
Then the ad's happy ending: the whole family watches
her leave with her boyfriend, on HomeView's door camera.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.729
Her messages: private. Her boyfriend:
family viewing.
